  "description": {
   "en": "Second-year highschooler Izuho Watari is busy with activities stanning her favorite idol, but through a strange turn of events, finds herself holding a photoshoot for the boys' volleyball club's album photographs. Once the photoshoot begins, she's captivated by the volleyball club member Yumenosaki-kun, who's just too cute! \n\nFrom this day forward begins her days of gazing at her \"Favorite Number Two.\"\n\n(Source: Ciao)",
   "ja": "推し活に忙しい高2の渡出帆は、ひょんなことから男子バレー部のアルバム写真を撮影することに。いざ撮影を始めてみたら、かわいすぎるバレー部員・夢乃咲くんのトリコに！その日から「第2の推し」を見つめる日々が始まり…。"
  },
